FF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-1no/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stranded-work reducer in sase-core[/bold #D7AFFF]                            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: add the pure Rust reducer that maps bead and session-member facts [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]to owned/delegated/settling/stranded/blocked/unknown verdicts. It [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]includes causes, ancestor propagation, wires, unit tests, and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`stranded_work_reduce` PyO3 binding.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Python fact collector, facade, presentation vocabulary, and [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]doctor[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]collect[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]collect: move the core pin. Add the binding facade and the cheap, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]dismissal-proof fact collector, and the shared ⚐ presentation vocabulary[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that ACE and doctor both use. Add the doctor report and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bead-lifecycle reference docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Agents tab rows, clans, waiters, and info strip[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]agents-rows[dim] · [dim][/dim]after collect[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]agents-rows: add the off-thread stranded-view cache and its warmup lane.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Render the STRANDED overlay, waiter and clan ⚐ tokens, breadcrumbs, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]▲ wave fold, and the info-strip count, with row-glyph docs, help legend,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and PNG goldens.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Agents detail callouts, toast, and query field[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]agents-detail[dim] · [dim][/dim]after agents-rows[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]agents-detail: add the AGENT TURN header callout, the \\[beads] wait-lane [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and WAVES markers, a transition toast that never fires at startup, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the `stranded` live-query field, with docs and PNG goldens.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Beads pane stranded badges[/bold #D7AFFF]                                    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]beads-pane[dim] · [dim][/dim]after collect[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]beads-pane: add a deferred stranded pass and the phase/epic ⚐ badges, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the legend entry, the status-bar count, and the detail property row, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with docs and a PNG golden.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]One-keystroke resolution from any flagged row[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]resolve[dim] · [dim][/dim]after agents-detail, beads-pane[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolve: add a `stranded` Enter target and a resolve modal offering [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Continue (a prefilled `%id(bead=…) #fork:<last turn>` takeover) or Close[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bead (the shared BeadCloseModal). Wire it to `w` on Beads-pane rows, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with help, docs, and a PNG golden.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-1no","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-1no.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-9b224e36600f750c7a3103c7a4e16605","started_at":"2026-10-23T18:25:54.382410+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities"